      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners praise Dr. Hernandez, Dr. Rios, and front desk coordinators like Lucy, Summer, and Jessica for their compassionate guidance and clear treatment breakdowns. Clients value clinicians who listen closely to symptoms and treat pets like family. While two reviewers felt examinations were rushed, the vast majority report caring attention."
