      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently highlight the clinic as one of the most budget-friendly veterinary practices in the area, pointing to forty-dollar consultation fees and transparent surgical quotes for mass removals. Pet owners appreciate receiving dependable medical care without exorbitant emergency charges."
      }
